{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Katana Dance</strong> is the adrenaline-fueled lovechild of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>Hi-Fi Rush </strong>\u2014a level-based, beat-driven blood-dance where every slash, sprint, and wall-run snaps on-beat in vibrant, hand-animated arenas. No upgrades, no metagame\u2014just you, your katana, and pure, pulse-pounding tempo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/f5f766bab6f410955484b1ec78e99aeb.poster.avif?t=1759774499\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/f5f766bab6f410955484b1ec78e99aeb.webm?t=1759774499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/f5f766bab6f410955484b1ec78e99aeb.mp4?t=1759774499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn score</strong> by taking out enemies in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build momentum</strong> by slaying foes in time with the music, then <i>wall-run</i>, <i>jump</i>, <i>dash</i>, and <i>slide</i> to keep up the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each beat <i>your life slowly drains</i>, but every action in sync with the rhythm adds health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOM MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/dbadc1b07075f3ad0920b555ee071efe.poster.avif?t=1759774499\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/dbadc1b07075f3ad0920b555ee071efe.webm?t=1759774499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/extras/dbadc1b07075f3ad0920b555ee071efe.mp4?t=1759774499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import any track via the built-in music editor and play RKD to your own soundtrack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is included in the demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default Play mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six levels to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to add up to five custom tracks and play the levels with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 enemy types</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action\u2014yours and your enemies\u2019\u2014is perfectly synced to the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-run, jump, and slide in time with the music to maintain momentum and boost your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your katana to deflect bullets and dispatch foes with stylish precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721510?t=1759774499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/ec62b22872fac7a320493ff46cef357d9dd4a8dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759774499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/d0543ed5358fd2728bb574cb5740fcbb8c0aca55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759774499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721510/d0543ed5358fd2728bb574cb5740fcbb8c0aca55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759774499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed